  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening tripartite efforts to support the Decent Work Agenda in the Caribbean</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO is currently supporting the development and implementation Decent Work Country Programmes (DWCPs) in 5 Caribbean countries (Bahamas, Suriname, Belize, Guyana and Barbados) with 2 additional DWCPs in design phase (Jamaica and Trinidad and Tobago). This process requires that there are strong tripartite dialogue mechanisms in place to agree on priorities and undertake monitoring and implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
